<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for applying for admission to the Herberger Institute School of Music at Arizona State University. You have been scheduled for the following in the School of Music on the ASU Tempe Campus. Important: <b>Please confirm your appointment(s) <a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions/confirm">online</a>&nbsp;within 24 hours of receipt of this email.</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Event<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>Instrument<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>Date<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>Time<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>Location</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Music Composition&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Interview<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span> <span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">						</span></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Composition Theory and Aural Skills Exam (Composition Applicants Only)</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">In addition to an interview with members of the composition faculty, an exam in theory and aural skills is scheduled at 9 a.m. for all composition applicants. Please check-in to Cowley Lobby by 8:45 a.m. for the exam at 9 a.m.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Remember to confirm your audition(s) and interview(s) <a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions/confirm">online</a>&nbsp;within 24 hours of receipt of this email</b>. Voice applicants who have requested an ASU accompanist for the audition are required to enter their audition repertoire information on the confirmation form. See below for further instructions.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Audition Day Check-In&nbsp;</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Check-in begins at 8 a.m. in Cowley Lobby, the main lobby of the Music Building. You are kindly requested to check in at least 30-minutes prior to your earliest scheduled audition/interview. Practice rooms are available for you to warm up before your audition. Please be courteous and surrender the room after 20 minutes to allow other students to warm up for their auditions.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Audition/Interview Weekend Events</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Attend a concert or production while you are on campus! A schedule of events taking place during audition and interview weekends is posted <a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions/auditions/events">here.</a> We encourage you to attend the informational sessions that are offered each audition day so that we may answer any questions that you may have about ASU and the Herberger Institute School of Music.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Voice Audition Preparation</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Voice applicants who have requested an ASU accompanist for the audition are required to bring piano scores of their pieces to the audition for the pianist. Scores should be double-sided and in a three-ring binder.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Once again, thank you for your interest in studying in the Herberger Institute School of Music. We look forward to meeting you soon.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">ASU School of Music in the Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts</font></div><div><font face="arial">Office of Admissions</font></div><div><font face="arial">480.965.5069 | <a href="mailto:musicadmin@asu.edu">musicadmin@asu.edu</a></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>